# Per-session agent scaffolding. Written fresh by each agent run and addressed
# to whoever is reading that run, so committing them would mean every session
# overwriting the last one's and a repository full of stale advice about a
# session nobody remembers.
#
# TODO.md is deliberately NOT here. It is the durable checklist,
# .claude/hooks/todo-context.sh injects it into every session, and that hook
# no-ops silently when the file is absent — so an uncommitted TODO.md is one
# machine's private note that vanishes on clone.
#
# If something in one of these turns out to be durable, move it into TODO.md,
# AI.md or ACCESSIBILITY.md before the file is regenerated.
PLAN.md
QUESTIONS.md
SESSION.md
